---
// src/pages/dams.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ImageCarousel from '../components/ImageCarousel.astro';
import '../styles/dams.css';

const title = "Our Dams - Southern Golden Retrievers";
const description = "Meet Lilly, Roux, and Raine - our tested, certified, and award-winning golden retriever dams in Knoxville, TN.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
    <div class="container">
        <section class="hero">
            <h1>Meet Our Dams</h1>
            <p>Each of our dams is health-tested, well-loved, and an important part of our family. Take a look at our favorite moments with them and at some of their pups.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- PLACEHOLDER: fill in the dams' certifications and health tests -->
        <section class="card dam-certifications">
            <h2>Health Testing &amp; Certifications</h2>
            <p>All of our dams have ___ certifications and ___ health tests.</p>
        </section>

        <section id="lilly" class="card dam-section">
            <h2>Lilly</h2>
            <ImageCarousel folders={['Lilly']} alt="Lilly" />
            <div class="dam-description">
                <p>Our beautiful female Lilly is a wonderful example of the breed’s loving and intelligent nature. She has had two successful litters and has proven to be an attentive, nurturing mother who produces healthy, well-socialized puppies with excellent temperaments.</p>
                <p>She is affectionate, loyal, and very people-oriented, making her an outstanding family dog. She loves to play with toys, enjoys spending time outdoors, and has a fun personality that really shines around water — she even likes to dive underwater when swimming.</p>
                <p>She’s also extremely social and gentle with other dogs, especially her sisters, who she absolutely adores. Her calm, friendly temperament and playful spirit are qualities we’ve seen passed down to her puppies.</p>
                <p class="dam-traits-heading">Her puppies are expected to have:</p>
                <ul class="dam-traits">
                    <li>Friendly, family-oriented personalities</li>
                    <li>Strong intelligence and trainability</li>
                    <li>Playful and affectionate temperaments</li>
                    <li>Excellent social behavior with people and other dogs</li>
                    <li>The classic beauty and charm of the Golden Retriever breed</li>
                </ul>
                <p>She has been a cherished member of our family, and we’re proud of the loving personality, maternal instincts, and quality she brings to her puppies.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="roux" class="card dam-section">
            <h2>Roux</h2>
            <ImageCarousel folders={['Roux']} alt="Roux" />
            <div class="dam-description">
                <p>Roux is a beautiful female Golden Retriever with an exceptional combination of beauty, personality, and proven quality. At only 11 months old, she earned Best in Show at a dog show, highlighting her outstanding structure, appearance, and breed standards.</p>
                <p>She has also had one successful litter of healthy, well-socialized puppies and showed wonderful maternal instincts from the very beginning. Roux is attentive, gentle, and naturally nurturing, producing puppies with sweet, affectionate temperaments.</p>
                <p>What truly makes Roux special is her loving personality. She absolutely adores cuddling, giving kisses, and getting as much attention as possible. She is extremely people-oriented and thrives on affection, making her not only a beautiful dog, but an incredible companion as well.</p>
                <p class="dam-traits-heading">Roux’s puppies are expected to inherit:</p>
                <ul class="dam-traits">
                    <li>Friendly, affectionate personalities</li>
                    <li>Strong social and family-oriented temperaments</li>
                    <li>Intelligence and trainability</li>
                    <li>Excellent breed quality and appearance</li>
                    <li>Loving companion traits</li>
                </ul>
                <p>She is a cherished part of our family, and we’re proud to offer puppies from such a well-rounded, affectionate, and accomplished dog.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="raine" class="card dam-section">
            <h2>Raine (Retired)</h2>
            <ImageCarousel folders={['Raine']} alt="Raine" />
            <div class="dam-description">
                <p>Raine is a beautiful female Golden Retriever with an incredibly sweet personality and a proven history of producing wonderful puppies. She has had two successful litters of healthy, well-socialized puppies.</p>
                <p>She has the friendly, affectionate temperament the breed is known for and absolutely loves being around people. Raine is full of personality — she loves showing her belly for attention, spins in circles when it’s time for food, and makes her adorable signature “wookie” noise whenever she gets excited playing with her toys. Her playful, loving nature makes her a favorite with everyone she meets.</p>
                <p>Raine is gentle, social, and eager to please, with the kind of calm and affectionate temperament that makes an outstanding family companion. Her puppies inherited her friendly disposition, intelligence, and playful personality.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</Layout>